	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. P.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quum primum <placeName ref="l491">Argentinam</placeName> reversus <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>inspexi cum <persName ref="p8041">Ioanne a Lasco</persName>, cuius coram memini, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>epistolam, facile agnovi eam ipsam esse, quam <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>mihi isthic legendam dedisti.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Porro interea, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quod isthinc decessi, accepi a D. <persName ref="p540">Calvino</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>scriptum illud suum de eucharistia seu <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>cęna dominica, quod is sponte sua ad me misit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Quare non erit necesse, ut aliud ipse trans<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>mittas.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Faceres autem mihi rem gratissimam, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>si quod habes de cęna Domini a <persName ref="p467">Bucero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>quod olim, priusquam ita desiperet, scripsit, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ad me transmitteres.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Ego hoc beneficium, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>si quando res tuę ita postulaverint, quacumque <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ratione compensavero.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">D. <persName ref="p506">Butlerus</persName> pollicitus <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>est mihi se curaturum apud <persName ref="p8417">Musculum</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/><persName ref="p8049">Vadianum</persName> et aliquot alios, ut et ab illis <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>eorum impetretur sententia in eodem argu<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>mento, quod vobis proposui, cuius haud dubie <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>probe meministi.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Si quid ille hic videa<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>tur egere tua opera, vide, queso, ne eam <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>detractes: utinam vero communem <placeName ref="l41">Bernensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ecclesię consensum obtineamus!</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Si quid <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>forte obtineatur, ut quę isthinc literę ad me <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>scribantur, transmitti poterunt <placeName ref="l157">Francofordi<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>am</placeName> ad quendam <persName>Adrianum Edingum</persName>, D. <lb xml:id="p1z26"/><persName ref="p506">Butlero</persName> ac etiam <persName ref="p4851">Froschovero</persName> probe notum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Cęterum in novis nihil pręter tristia <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>omnia hic habemus.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Omnes istę ecclesię <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>indies magis magisque videntur labascere <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>atque ad interitum prorsus vergere.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Flaccescunt enim omnium hominum animi, quo<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>rum partes erant virilius agere.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Interea <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>rident adversarii plenis (quod aiunt) buccis, <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>quibus et religio omnisque pietas summo est <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>ludibrio.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Seniores ac constantiores in fide <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ac rebus bene gerendis, quique de religione <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>bene sunt meriti, atque adeo prophetę ipsi, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>aut ę vivisaut ę <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName> alibi <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>passim sunt evocati.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Huc accedit, <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>quod execrabiles in Deum et verbum eius <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>quotidie blasphemias audiamus ab illis, <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>qui olim Christum agnoverunt, iamque a <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>nobis defecerunt ad adversarios.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Postremo <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>nulla videmus populum duci pęnitentia, <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>quin potius solito magis socordem perversioremque <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>evadere; unde certum est, nihil nobis <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>nisi gravissimas pęnas propter <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>nostram ingratitudinem manere.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Interim <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>Deus nostri misereatur propter Dominum nostrum <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>Iesum Christum, nobisque fidem adauge<lb xml:id="p2z19"/>at suo Spiritu, quo firmi stemus, vel in medio <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>omnium malorum agmine, in confessione nominis <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>eius.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Cętera ex reliquorum literis facile <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>cognoveris.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Decreveram quidem <placeName ref="l267">Colonia</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>in <placeName ref="l830">Angliam</placeName> proficisci; verum propter gravia, <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>quę me in <placeName ref="l640">Flandria</placeName> manent, pericula, consiliis <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>amicorum parens, per <persName>Callias</persName> profectionem <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>meditamur, quam cras volente Domino instituemus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z27"/>Interim me studiose tuis commendo precibus.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p2z28"/>Vale, vir multo ornatissime ac praeceptor <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>honorande, et me in diarium amicorum <lb xml:id="p2z30"/>tuorum adscribito.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Deus te suo Spiritu <lb xml:id="p2z31"/>corroboret, ut fortiter infractoque animo <lb xml:id="p2z32"/>Spartam, quam es nactus, tuearis ad extremum <lb xml:id="p2z33"/>usque vitę tuę diem ad gloriam nominis illius.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p2z34"/>Iterum vale, neque committe quin aliquid <pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>eorum, que nos rescire operae pretium fore <lb xml:id="p3z2"/>existimaveris, proximis <placeName ref="l157">Francfordiensibus</placeName> nundinis <lb xml:id="p3z3"/>significes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z4"/><placeName ref="l491">Argentinę</placeName>, 7. iulii, <lb xml:id="p3z5"/>1549.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z6"/>Tuus ut suus, <lb xml:id="p3z7"/><persName ref="p8061">Io. Utenhovius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Et singulari <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>pietate et omnimoda <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>eruditione conspicuo <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>viro D. <persName ref="p495">Heynricho <lb xml:id="p4z5"/>Bulingero</persName>, fratri <lb xml:id="p4z6"/>suo multo charissimo.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p4z7"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
